# Server-only: used by the translate-and-send API route. Copy to .env and set.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Supabase (migration option B) — set all when using Postgres + Realtime instead of in-process /ws
# Server: insert with service role (never expose to the client)
# SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# Client (build-time public vars; required for the browser to subscribe to Realtime)
# PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
# PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...